# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and adjust as needed.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code — a safety
# rail so you can't accidentally ship a server secret to the browser. Anything
# in here IS shipped to the browser, so never put real secrets here.

# Base path for all API calls. Left as a relative path so the dev proxy
# (see vite.config.ts) and a production reverse proxy both "just work".
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
